# pagen

pagen is a VERY small and VERY minimal markdown to html converter written in C

## building

` $ cc -std=c99 -Wall -Wextra pagen.c -o pagen `

or

` $ make `

## usage

pagen converts from markdown to html and prints the converted output to the standard output

there are 2 ways (?) into writing the output into files

- interactive mode (redirecting terminal output into file)

` $ ./pagen <<EOT> filename.html `

write the message as you go in markdown and it will be converted into html

- converting mode

` $ ./pagen [PATH]> filename.html `
